1. घुष् cl. 1. P. घोषति (rarely Ā. ˚ते, R. v, 56, 139; Subj. घो॑षात्; pf. जुघोष, JaimBr.; 3. pl. जुघुषुर्, Pāṇ. vii, 2, 23, Kāś.; aor. Ā. घो॑षि) Ā. to sound, RV. iv, 4, 8;
 P. to cry or proclaim aloud, call out, announce publicly, declare, i, 139, 8; MBh. xiii, xiv; R. &c.:
Caus. घोषयति (subj. 2. sg. ˚ष॑यस्), to call to, invite, RV. ix, 108, 3;
to cause to proclaim aloud, MBh. i, iii;
to proclaim aloud, MBh.; R. &c.
